        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be \"fixed\" on latest `main`. [Executing `MiniNotify.setup(MiniNotify.config)`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3d81b8ab6ad4b805c2e7b42f2e93e3dbb68dd12a/doc/mini-notify.txt#L83-L84) now also cleans all notification history. This way if users has to many notifications (to the point that it becomes trouble), they can manually clean the history.\r\n\r\nThanks for bringing up no way of controlling history size in 'mini.notify'!",
